//- NamedFragment.js
// `ISub` implements `IBase`, which implements `ITop`, so the client type
// `ClientEntity` (implements `ISub`) is listed under `__isITop`. The server
// makes `ISub` stop implementing `IBase`: the incremental build no longer lists
// it, as a full build does not.
graphql`fragment NamedFragment on ITop {
  name
}`

//- NamedQuery.js
graphql`query NamedQuery {
  top {
    ...NamedFragment
  }
}`

